            "review_title": "Review at IL Forno Italian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tra Nguyen\nParis, France8 contributions\n0\nBest Italian family owned restaurant in hanoi\nOct 2019 • Couples\nIt's been three years I come here regularly. They are the only Italian restaurant family own in Hanoi. They make all their pastas and pizza themselves. They import their own ingredients from Italy. And furthermore they offer unbeatable price. 40k to 60k for a dish. \n\nFinally they are super nice. A real Italian family. I recommend a 100 times!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 21, 2019\nSunshine16349965987\nThank you so much, happy to see you again, welcome to Il Forno\nWritten October 22, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
