            "review_title": "Review at IL Forno Italian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "JanosD\nPhilippines6 contributions\n0\nThe mamma food in hanoi\nOct 2019 • Solo\nI been many different time in this restaurant where I found a piece of Italy in Hanoi managed by a Italian/Vietnamise couple. Far from luxury its simple, nice,clean,and very affordable ,but more important it's the food amazing.I m italian my self and I don't go when I travel in search of Italian food. First because generally speaking its expensive and often disappointed me. So why il forno.As Italian food its a religion and here I found the real Italian food made at the best. I try allmost everything, hand made pinza, pizza,pasta with tomato and pesto sauce,gnocchi with butter and sage and more,and.i found the same test in the food as Italian mamma cook in Italy. This s why impressed me any time I went at il Forno. Genuine food good and healthy no msg,no to salty,no sweeter.Perfect balanced food.This s I why I high recommend this place. Try and contest me if not true and when you have to pay your bill you will be surprise. Very affordable for a italian restaurant.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 20, 2019\nSunshine16349965987\nThank you very much for your visit Il Forno, we will improve more menu when you come back one day, all the food we cook by passion and want bring it to everyone love Italian food. Big hug to you friend from Tonino and Thanh\nRead more\nWritten October 20, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
