            "review_text": "annika g\nHanoi, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\nWe come here all the time\nOct 2019 • Family\nOur whole family’s most favourite restaurant 🥰 and the best Italian in this country. If not the planet. It’s delicious Italian street food and we love the small portions (except the pasta maybe which are bigger portions) so you can combine different kinds - pizza, lasagne, pasta, all super fresh and home made, including the pasta dough. Not expensive. Never remember to take pictures of the actual food but like my son just said it’s all just amazing, food and the people and everything (Thanh and Antonio are lovely).\nRead more\nWritten October 19, 2019\nSunshine16349965987\nThank you so much, we all happy to see your family and remember your favorite food when you visit us. Your visit is Il Forno's pleasure ❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️\nRead more\nWritten October 20, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
